<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title || 'Application Submitted | Pastors LMS' %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/global.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/login.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/onboarding.css">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
</head>

<body>
  <div class="login-viewport">
    <div class="login-bg-pattern"></div>
    <div class="login-glow-1"></div>
    <div class="login-glow-2"></div>

    <div class="login-card" style="max-width: 580px;">
      <div class="login-header">
        <div class="login-brand">
          <img src="/images/ida-logo.jpg" alt="Intentional Discipleship Africa" class="login-logo">
          <div class="login-brand-text">
            <div class="login-brand-title">PASTORS <span class="login-brand-accent">LMS</span></div>
            <div class="login-brand-tagline">EQUIPPING FAITHFUL SHEPHERDS</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="success-icon" style="color: var(--success); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: flex; justify-content: center;">
          <svg width="68" height="68" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="var(--success-bg)" />
            <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" />
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h1 class="login-title">Application Submitted!</h1>
        <p class="login-subtitle">Thank you for completing your 5-step pastoral training application.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="success-content">
        <div class="info-box" style="background: var(--surface-alt); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.75rem;">
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Candidate Summary</h3>
          
          <div class="info-row" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0.4rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">Name:</span>
            <span style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-title);"><%= full_name %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="info-row" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0.4rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">Email:</span>
            <span style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-title);"><%= email %></span>
          </div>

          <% if (typeof church_name !== 'undefined' && church_name) { %>
          <div class="info-row" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0.4rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">Church:</span>
            <span style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-title);"><%= church_name %></span>
          </div>
          <% } %>

          <div class="info-row" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0.4rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem;">
            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">Application Status:</span>
            <span style="color: #9A711A; background: var(--gold-light); font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.8rem; border: 1px solid var(--gold);">
              Pending Review
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="next-steps" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">What Happens Next?</h3>
          <ol style="padding-left: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-body); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6;">
            <li>Your application and church affiliation details have been placed in queue for review by pastoral admissions.</li>
            <li>Once reviewed and approved by an administrator, your status will become <strong>Active</strong>.</li>
            <li>You will use your email address (<strong><%= email %></strong>) and password to access courses.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="action-buttons" style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px;">
          <a href="/logout" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; text-decoration: none;">
            Sign Out
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="login-footer-note" style="margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-light); text-align: center;">
        “Holding fast the faithful word as taught, that he may be able by sound doctrine to exhort.” — Titus 1:9
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>
